  "visual_review": "Personally inspected both 1200x1000 sheets and the 1281x266 closeup: all 18 held/worn captures have the intended scene and no Zink-style red/cyan artifact. All 15 Hardened Glowstone held/worn sources visibly glow with native emission and lose that glow in the alpha-zero control; ordinary controls remain stable. The placed native block is brighter than ordinary Glowstone and its alpha-zero counterpart under matched BSL settings. The source block texture is deliberately a flat center with a distinct border; the border and cube silhouette remain recognizable at this exposure. Software llvmpipe profile, shader toggling, command acknowledgements, artifact identity, and four-distance companion-on evidence were authenticated by the auditor."
